Firecrawl returned: {"success":true,"data":{"markdown":"[Integer Telecom Services](https://integertel.com/)\n\n[Home](https://integertel.com/) [About us](https://integertel.com/about-us/) [Services](https://integertel.com/services/) [Contact us](https://integertel.com/contact-us/)\n\n# Connecting the Future, One Fiber at a Time\n\n[Contact Us!](https://integertel.com/contact-us/)\n\n## About Us\n\nInteger Telecom Services, Inc. is dedicated to providing high-quality fiber design and construction services in the telecommunications industry. With over 10 years of experience, we offer a range of services to our clients, including design, construction, splicing and maintenance. Our team of experts is committed to delivering efficient, reliable, and cutting-edge solutions to meet the evolving needs of the telecom industry.\n\n## Our Services\n\n**Design Services:** Our design services include GIS mapping, fiber optic network design, and network engineering, as well as project management services. We also utilize OSP design tools such as QGIS, ESRI/ArcGIS, and BendixKing to provide our clients with the most accurate and comprehensive designs. **Expert Knowledge of OSP Design Tools:** QGIS, ESRI/ArcGIS, and BendixKing OSP Design tools.\n\n**Construction Services:** Our construction services include project management, site preparation, trenching and boring, fiber optic cable placement and splicing, aerial and underground fiber installations, civil contracting, and coordination with utility companies. \n\n**Splicing Services:** Our splicing services include fiber optic cable splicing, OTDR testing, fiber optic cable testing and documentation, and equipment installation.\n\n**Maintenance Services:** Our maintenance services include fiber optic cable maintenance, splicing and restoration, aerial and underground maintenance, and routine and emergency maintenance services.\n\n## Partnerships\n\nWe are proud to partner with leading companies in the telecom industry to provide ou